# BEGIN T1-I1 (T1 packages). INT-B set both to measured - 1, rounded down, from the CI coverage job on the merged T1 branch (run
# 42251326395: dsp/... 94.8, transform 89.3); the 90 % figures of the plan are aims, not gates. internal/score/... (T1b) is NOT listed:
# the gate refuses a pattern that matches no package, so its floor is added by the lane that creates the package.
internal/dsp/...        93
internal/transform      88
# END T1-I1
# BEGIN E2-I1 (E2 packages). Floors are the unit-test coverage measured on the merged E2 branch (go test, no -short) minus one full
